572212871976,0.7614510925086175,"In June 2021, a subsidiary indirectly owned by the",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.7629224697382831,0.9585384711493935,0.7732118209946864,"Company entered into a business cooperation",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.774683198224352,0.9708342459007955,0.7849725494807553,"contract (“the BCC”) with a third party to cooperate",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.7864439267104211,0.968708980398785,0.7967332779668244,"in manufacturing of raw fish sauce for a period of 5",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.7982046551964901,0.9701921903823959,0.8084940064528933,"years. In which, this subsidiary will contribute to the",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.809965383682559,0.9668270580539893,0.8202547349389623,"BCC by cash for capital expenditure purpose. The",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.821726112168628,0.9674176668161066,0.8320154634250313,"third party will contribute the rights to use all of its",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.8334868406546969,0.9738078684138959,0.8437761919111002,"lands, factory, warehouse, machinery, equipment and",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.8452475691407658,0.9703707106266946,0.8555369203971691,"related infrastructures. This subsidiary and the third",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.8570082976268348,0.9687959254169016,0.8672976488832381,"party will share profits of the BCC according to the",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.8687690261129037,0.9716980369387704,0.879058377369307,"agreed ratio between the parties in the BCC. During",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.8805297545989728,0.9684625504361944,0.890819105855376,"the year, the parties have agreed to early terminate",1],[0.8540305593732314,0.8922904830850417,0.9644034013655434,0.902579834341445,"and liquidate this business cooperation contract.",1],[0.4219549767387165,0.12206051608446113,0.46874065690158234,0.1323498673408644,"Form B 09 – DN/HN",1],[0.352162307166533,0.13382124457053005,0.4687391134988939,0.14411059582693334,"(Issued under Circular No. 202/2014/TT-BTC dated",1],[0.365198915208396,0.14558197305659895,0.4687396279664568,0.15587132431300